# Repo-root ignores: the Flutter app (which lives here) plus what is shared.
#
# The Python rules that used to be here moved to app_qt/.gitignore when the Qt
# app was frozen into that folder. One of them was actively dangerous: `/lib/`
# existed only to stop the unanchored Python `lib/` rule from swallowing the
# Flutter source when it lived at app/lib/. With the Dart source now at lib/,
# that anchored rule matched the ENTIRE source tree. Deleting it is why this
# file is a rewrite rather than an edit.

# ---- Flutter / Dart ----
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
# pubspec.lock IS committed: this is an application, so builds must be
# reproducible.

# Local report/preview artifacts from throwaway rasterisation tests.
preview/

# ---- Signing secrets — NEVER commit (see MOBILE_RELEASE.md) ----
android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
ios/fastlane/report.xml
ios/fastlane/Preview.html
ios/fastlane/*.mobileprovision
**/*.p8

# ---- Docs (Sphinx, built by Read the Docs from docs/) ----
docs/_build/

# ---- Editors / OS ----
*.iml
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Stale local scratch ----
archive/
test_save_probe.png

# Sphinx build output: docs/_generated/ is rendered from schema/tsv_schema.json
# by docs/_ext/generated_includes.py on every build, so it is never committed.
docs/_generated/
